            "review_title": "Review at Com Ga Hai Nam",
            "review_text": "Raymondale\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia1361 contributions\n0\nkieu singapore hainan chicken rice\nNov 2025 • Solo\nThis was my second time visiting this Singapore style Hainanese chicken rice restaurant. The first time was year 2023, that time I was staying at a nearby hotel. This time, I came for breakfast because I couldn’t stop thinking about their congee.\nI ordered a plate of Hainanese chicken rice and a bowl of fish congee. The chicken rice was good, and although the congee was a bit thin, it was still acceptable overall. The menu here is extensive, with many other dishes worth trying. I would come back again if I have the chance.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 29, 2025",
