            "review_title": "Review at Com Ga Hai Nam",
            "review_text": "Anna S\nMalaysia1137 contributions\n0\nVery pleasant and recommended restaurant with a wide range of food from Southeast Asian cuisine.\nMar 2025 • Couples\nFriendly staff and affordable prices\nOne sits very nicely on comfortable chairs (with backrest) and has a beautiful view of the lively hustle and bustle on the passing street Calmette. \nAlternatively: go to the first floor. Up there you have a better view of the passing road.\nThe audience: mainly locals; pleasant atmosphere.\nWe stayed in a very close hotel and ate here every night. Every time we ordered something different and every time we liked it very much.\nThe beer (Saigon) was good and also well chilled.\nThe prices are also very pleasant. You pay significantly less here than in the restaurants on the party mile not far away.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten May 25, 2025",
