            "review_title": "Review at Com Ga Hai Nam",
            "review_text": "Raymondale\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia1361 contributions\n0\nsingapore style chicken rice\nDec 2023 • Solo\ni had breakfast here twice. cuz my hotel didn't provide breakfast, and this restaurant close to my hotel, also it opened in the early morning, so very convenient.first time i came here on 30 Nov, i ordered com ga hainam (hai nan chicken rice), chao ga (shredded chicken congee), and iced tea. both are tasty, their chicken rice is singapore style, quite close to it, but still a bit different. at least the colour is different, chicken rice here same as other vietnam chicken rice, chicken meat is bright yellow colour. the chicken congee is good also. the second day i visited here on 2Dec, i ordered chao ca loc (sliced fish congee) and iced tea.the congee is tasty, love it, i think better than chicken congee. the dining place is big, and their menu also big, next time will come again, and try other food.if you come here, better don't compare to hai nan chicken rice, then you will enjoy singapore style vietnam chicken rice here.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\ncongee and chicken rice tasty\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 1, 2024",
