            "review_text": "J..\nMelbourne, Australia75 contributions\n0\nBest food in Vietnam\nNov 2022 • Couples\nI found this place when I was walking past and I saw all the tables full with people and others waiting. If the whole Ho Chi Minh City were there then I had to try it. Well what a place to find every dish coming out of the kitchen looked amazing and the food I ordered was superb and the prices were out of this world. I then ate there for the next 3 nights whilst I was in Ho Chi Minh City and tried different dishes. Whilst sitting there and eating I even noticed the amount of food that delivery drivers were picking up was insane. Never seen nothing like this in my life. Anything ordered from this place won’t disappoint so do yourself a favour and try it.\nRead more\nWritten November 9, 2022",
