            "review_title": "Review at Com Ga Hai Nam",
            "review_text": "AJ O'Grady\nSydney, Australia57 contributions\n0\nFavourite restaurant in HCMC\nJan 2021 • Couples\nThis is my most favourite restaurant in HCMC. I enjoy sitting outside and watching the buzz around this restaurant. It is excellent value. I have had the best roast pork belly I have had anywhere in the world. It is number 7 on the menu and comes with rice a dipping sauce for 48,000 dong. Singapore fried noodles are also excellent, 163 on the menu for 61000dong. The rice gruel has some varied and good options too. These are just a few meals on the menu. The menu is huge. You could eat here every day for a month and not repeat a meal and beers are between 20000 dong and 22000 dong. The absolute best value restaurant I have been in HCMC. You will not be disappointed.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 15, 2021",
