            "review_text": "Ray Kool\n1 contribution\n0\nA real surprise. Delicious Hainamese chicken.\nOct 2019\nWe wanted a late lunch and initially had minor communication issues, but the staff rallied and we were introduced to a wonderful staff member who really helped us.\nWe ordered, of course, the Singapore style Hainamese Chicken. It was prepared simply and we found it simply delicious. Not a flash place but the beers were cold, spring rolls yummy and the staff were obliging and friendly. The whole meal for three of us with beers was 233VND, a bargain. I recommend the restaurant for cheap eats and the pleasant obliging staff.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 26, 2019",
